[font_size=24]Additional Thanks[/font_size]
[color=#d14747]Panthera Digital[/color] for the [color=#d18c47]Godot Modular Character Controller[/color]
I took the FSM template and edited it into an HSM

[color=#d14747]Benvictus[/color] for [color=#d18c47]Dummy 2D Placeholder Assets[/color]
I used these assets in the first prototype versions of the game

[color=#d14747]Zegley[/color] for the [color=#d18c47]2D Pixel Art Character Template Asset Pack[/color]
I used this asset pack in later prototype versions of the game

[color=#d14747]Aarimous[/color] for the [color=#d18c47]AudioManager[/color]
I had lots of fun making this autoload DRY, adding Object Pooling and implementing Audio Randomization

[font_size=24]Special Thanks[/font_size]
[color=#d14747]From Software[/color] for their amazing games that changed my life

[color=#d14747]Miro Haverinen[/color] from [color=#d1478c]Happy Paintings [/color]for a series of games so good that left me in awe for months

A [color=#d14747]cruel and sharp bunny[/color] for making me believe in game development and motivating me to pursue this passion of mine

My [color=#d14747]friends[/color] that listened to my nonsense yapping about this project
